  /// pending → active (approve, assigns the member type's system role), pending → returned (return; the applicant fixes and resubmits), pending → rejected, active → suspended, suspended → active (reactivate), any → removed. Suspend and remove sign the member out. Any other move is a 400. Approving an `admin` also needs `roles.manage`.
  Future<MemberDetailEnvelope> membersSuspendCreate({
    Map<String, Object?> extra = const {
